# #5833. foreignHigh lives in the WAL shard's memory; without the start-head fallback a
# restart forgets another activation's append made before it. It edits an operator, not
# an action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestPreArmWatermarkNotReset
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: foreignHigh forgets what the WAL shard knew before it restarted
BOUNDS: WithRestart = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0

--- FIND
    Max({startHead - 1, evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a}}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no shardStartHead - 1 fallback.
    Max({-1, evFloor} \cup {o \in Offs : o >= TrackStart /\ author[o] \in Acts \ {a}}
--- END
